        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 22.733,
          "en": "at the React Core Syntax and JSX.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.733,
          "end": 24.933,
          "en": "We, of course, had a very detailed look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.933,
          "end": 28.9,
          "en": "at building and using and working with components and props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.9,
