          "en": "and H2 elements, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.9,
          "end": 102.333,
          "en": "And that is how the web works and how React works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.333,
          "end": 107.43299999999999,
          "en": "These custom components are not really HTML elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.43299999999999,
          "end": 111.2,
          "en": "which end up on the screen, you just use them in your code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.2,
          "end": 114.666,
